@startuml US106a-SSD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant ":System" as SYS

autonumber

Actor -> SYS : addCertification(\n  iataCode,\n  manufacturer, modelName )

SYS --> Actor : 200 OK\n( updated Airport resource + HATEOAS links )

note over SYS
  [Verifies Airport exists — identified by iataCode]
  [Identifies AircraftModel by manufacturer + modelName (ModelDesignation VO)]
  [Phase 1: AircraftModel cross-aggregate existence check deferred to Phase 2 — see US201]
  [Checks for duplicate certification on this airport]
  [Adds ModelDesignation to Airport's certified-models set]
  [Persists updated Airport aggregate]
end note

@enduml
